silm:instances_papers_09_minimal_category_theory_chapters_07_mittens_as_colimit_anchor_sections_04_negative_regression_audit_concrete_anchor_4_MicrochipIdentifier9#microchipidentifier9 silm:hasLongDescription "The MicrochipIdentifier9 is the microchip identifier 985112345678901 implanted in Mittens at 8 weeks. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'MicrochipIdentifier9', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
